{"segs": ["PA_ja_181:0.4"], "en": "1. The Asadisajātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_181:1.1", "PA_ja_181:1.2"], "en": "An incomparable archer, a prince of great strength.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_181:1.3"], "en": "Shooting from afar, piercing the mark at once,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_181:1.4"], "en": "and shattering massive bodies—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_181:2.1"], "en": "having waged war against all his enemies, he prevailed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_181:2.2"], "en": "And he did not harm anyone;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_181:2.3"], "en": "having ensured his brother’s safety,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_181:2.4"], "en": "he entered upon self-restraint.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
